{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 1022 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage history shows amoxicillin and clavulanate potassium was first posted on 2022-10-28 and is now resolved as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of NuCare Pharmaceuticals Inc. (FEI 3003294404) ended on 2020-01-10 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-02-26 — 1022 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "NuCare Pharmaceuticals Inc. received a Warning Letter on 2019-09-27 and multiple prior VAI inspections in 2010, 2015, and 2018.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another labeler, Asclemed USA Inc. (FEI 3001452204), had an OAI inspection ending 2018-09-27 and a Warning Letter on 2019-06-11.",
      "cites": ["E14", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory at Corvale East provides 19.2 days on hand for the 200 mg/5 mL + 28.5 mg/5 mL 100 mL presentation, while Corvale General holds 27.3 days for the same presentation and 26 days for the 400 mg/5 mL 50 mL presentation.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and operates plants in Jordan (2INAMOXU24N-E and 2INAMOXU12N).",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
